{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892560/extras/873e60bc12d53e0900118d86af4b4f5d.avif?t=1756314763\" width=612 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Because of a certain <strong><i>Dream</i></strong><i> </i>you had, you travel to a small, special town in dire need of help. Despite the efforts of the few villagers who live there, the town remains weathered, slowly being taken over by nature. Will you be able to help restore it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892560/extras/3f1af6e4a823c9e17bb70c078e57d927.poster.avif?t=1756314763\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892560/extras/3f1af6e4a823c9e17bb70c078e57d927.webm?t=1756314763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892560/extras/3f1af6e4a823c9e17bb70c078e57d927.mp4?t=1756314763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Befriend the villagers, unravel the town's secrets, conquer the challenges of the Dream World, and thrive!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892560/extras/f884110d748def1a633d158d37a67b85.avif?t=1756314763\" width=308 height=68 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up your town</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up various skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character, home, and town</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Dream World, battle quirky foes, and discover your origins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend the villagers and enjoy a variety of activities together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig for artifacts to reveal details about a forgotten civilization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cards, build your deck, and challenge the townsfolk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much, much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892560/extras/1bf272b7ea51c3eff43f9ba8dec4be84.poster.avif?t=1756314763\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892560/extras/1bf272b7ea51c3eff43f9ba8dec4be84.gif?t=1756314763\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892560/extras/41e9f1a0581e096d26bc56e99e480662.poster.avif?t=1756314763\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892560/extras/41e9f1a0581e096d26bc56e99e480662.apng?t=1756314763\" class=\"bb_img\" width=116 height=104 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3892560?t=1756314763","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3892560?t=1756314763","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892560/6519e32abbcc2ab70